  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;be the point obtained by the rotation of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>i</mi></math> about the origin through a right angle in the anticlockwise direction, and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;be the point obtained by the rotation of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>i</mi></math> about the origin through a right angle in the clockwise direction. Then the principal argument <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mn>33</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mn>33</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>",
